      "id": 218,
      "options": {
        "content": "# 🏢 UniFi Location Platform (ULP) - Mars Observatory\\n\\n## 🔧 **Service Overview**\\nThe **UniFi Location Platform (ULP) Go version 1.11.26** is running on mars, providing Ubiquiti's **Identity and Location Service** for indoor positioning and device management.\\n\\n## 🚀 **Main Components**\\n### Core Services\\n- **ulp-go-app** (PID 5831) - Main positioning service on **port 9443 (HTTPS)**\\n- **unifi-user-assets-app** (PID 5733) - User assets service on **port 9780 (HTTP)**\\n\\n## 📊 **Current Activity**\\n### Device Tracking (5 devices)\\n- 📱 **2 MacBook Pro models** (M1 & Intel)\\n- 💻 **1 MacBook Air M1**\\n- 📱 **2 iPhones** (11 Pro & 15 Pro)\\n\\n### Location Management\\n- 🏢 **1 building location** managed\\n- 🆔 **UUID**: `dbc6e391-bc7a-4309-8cef-919b5c08694d`\\n\\n### API Services\\n- 🔐 **Identity management** (`/api/v2/identity/*`)\\n- 👤 **User management** (`/api/v2/user/*`)\\n- 💼 **Workspace information**\\n- 📍 **Location services**\\n- 📱 **Device registration and tracking**\\n\\n## ⚙️ **Real-time Operations**\\n- 🧹 **Location cleanup**: Automatic cleanup of deleted locations hourly\\n- 🔐 **RADIUS provisioning**: WiFi user credentials updated every 5 minutes\\n- 📱 **Device monitoring**: Continuous tracking of connected devices\\n- 🆔 **Identity services**: User authentication and authorization management\\n\\n## 🏗️ **Technical Implementation**\\n- 🗄️ **Database**: PostgreSQL backend with 65+ tables\\n- 🏛️ **Architecture**: Golang-based microservices architecture\\n- 🔒 **Security**: Encrypted database, SSL/TLS endpoints, device authentication\\n- 🔗 **Integration**: Connected to UniFi Network Controller for WiFi positioning\\n\\n## 🔗 **Quick Links**\\n- **ULP API Console**: [https://mars.int.bozza.au:9443](https://mars.int.bozza.au:9443)\\n- **User Assets Service**: [http://mars.int.bozza.au:9780](http://mars.int.bozza.au:9780)\\n- **Prometheus**: [http://192.168.22.253:9090](http://192.168.22.253:9090)\\n- **Loki Logs**: Use the Explore tab → Loki data source\\n\\n## 📝 **Monitoring Notes**\\n- **Service Health**: Monitor the \\\"ULP Services Status\\\" panel for service availability\\n- **Device Tracking**: Real-time device position tracking via WiFi triangulation\\n- **API Activity**: RESTful API usage for identity and location services\\n- **Error Monitoring**: Watch the error panels for service issues\\n\\n---\\n**🏢 Indoor Positioning API Service | 🚀 Deployed on Mars (192.168.22.1) | Built with ❤️ for Enterprise Location Analytics**\",\n        \"mode\": \"markdown\"\n      },\n      \"pluginVersion\": \"8.0.0\",\n      \"title\": \"📋 ULP Service Documentation & Reference Guide\",\n      \"type\": \"text\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"refresh\": \"30s\",\n  \"schemaVersion\": 27,\n  \"style\": \"dark\",\n  \"tags\": [\"unifi\", \"location\", \"platform\", \"ulp\", \"mars\", \"indoor-positioning\", \"device-tracking\"],\n  \"templating\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by device type\",\n        \"hide\": 0,\n        \"includeAll\": true,\n        \"label\": \"Device Type\",\n        \"multi\": true,\n        \"name\": \"device_type\",\n        \"options\": [\n          {\n            \"selected\": true,\n            \"text\": \"All\",\n            \"value\": \"$__all\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"selected\": false,\n            \"text\": \"MacBook\",\n            \"value\": \"MacBook\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"selected\": false,\n            \"text\": \"iPhone\",\n            \"value\": \"iPhone\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"query\": \"MacBook, iPhone\",\n        \"queryValue\": \"\",\n        \"skipUrlSync\": false,\n        \"type\": \"custom\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"time\": {\n    \"from\": \"now-1h\",\n    \"to\": \"now\"\n  },\n  \"timepicker\": {},\n  \"timezone\": \"\",\n  \"title\": \"🏢 UniFi Location Platform (ULP) - Mars Observatory\",\n  \"uid\": \"ulp-mars-dashboard\",\n  \"version\": 1\n}
